---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Company vehicles — alcohol interlock for pool cars and grey fleet | Interlock Alert"
  description="Camera-verified alcohol interlock for UK pool cars, grey fleet and assigned-driver vehicles. Close the duty-of-care gap on every mile your branding travels."
>
  <section class="hero hero--inner">
    <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">For company vehicles</span>
        <h1 class="display">
          When your brand's on the bodywork, <span class="display__fade">every mile is your problem.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__sub">
          Pool cars, grey fleet and named-driver vehicles. The moment your branding goes on the door, every mile is the company's problem — duty of care, insurance and reputation included. Interlock Alert closes the gap between policy on paper and policy in the cab.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__cta">
          <a href="/contact" class="button button--primary button--lg">
            <span class="button__label">Get a Free Quote</span>
            <svg class="icon-18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__visual reveal reveal--delay-2">
        <figure class="hero__media">
          <img
            src="/images/car-fleet.jpg"
            alt="Row of company fleet cars parked outside a UK office building"
            class="hero__media-img"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--band">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header section__header--center reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">The problem</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">Grey fleet is the duty-of-care blind spot most policies don't cover.</h2>
        <p class="section__lede">A driver alcohol policy is only as enforceable as the evidence behind it. With pool cars passing between staff and grey fleet vehicles operating outside the depot, manual checks rarely happen — and when an incident lands, HR, Fleet and Legal each find out at the same time. Interlock Alert turns the policy into something measurable, on every key turn, with a record you can actually show.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">What you get</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">A duty-of-care system that works for the way company cars get used.</h2>
        <p class="section__lede">Pool cars, named-driver fleets and grey-fleet vehicles all behave differently — but the duty-of-care evidence you need is the same. Interlock Alert turns it into a single, exportable record per test, ready for HR, Fleet, Legal or your insurer when they ask.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-camera"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Verified driver, every time</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">A camera at the moment of sample ties every test to the person who took it — even on shared pool cars and weekend handovers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-1">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sliders"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Per-vehicle BAC limits</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Set zero-tolerance on the company-branded car and a road-legal threshold on the personal-use vehicle. Adjust per vehicle in a tap.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-2">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">HR &amp; Fleet-ready reports</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">One-click compliance exports you can hand to HR, Fleet, Legal or your insurer — signed, timestamped and ready for the file.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bell"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Live alerts to the right person</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">A failed test reaches the line manager and HR contact within seconds. The conversation happens before the damage does.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-1">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bolt"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">EV &amp; hybrid compatible</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Certified for pure-electric and hybrid drivetrains alongside petrol and diesel. One supplier across a modern executive fleet.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-2">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wrench"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Discreet, dealer-grade fitting</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Engineered to the ECU, hidden in the cabin. Warranty-safe, MOT-safe, and visually invisible to the driver.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalCTA
    heading="Turn the policy on the page into evidence on the dashboard."
    body="Tell us a little about the fleet — vehicle count, drivetrain mix and where they're based — and we'll send a tailored quote with an installation plan that fits around the working week."
  />
</Layout>
